# pop'n music 9 (Konami Python 1): boot -> 2 coins -> red starts -> NORMAL (red) ->
# song select (red picks the song under the cursor, red again to confirm) -> the song,
# played with one button every 10 frames, cycling 1..9 -> results.
game popn9

at 3200 press "Coin 1" 8
at 3240 press "Coin 1" 8
at 3400 press "P1 Button 5" 8     # red: start
at 3900 press "P1 Button 5" 8     # mode select: NORMAL
at 3950 snap
at 4300 snap
at 4500 press "P1 Button 5" 8     # song select: this song
at 4550 snap
at 4700 press "P1 Button 5" 8     # confirm
at 4750 snap
at 5000 snap
